Body:
As a temporary workaround, you can disable the "unnecessary" variants for a specific model :)

Something like this in opencode.json file (tested in opencode 1.18.25):
```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "provider": {
    "opencode-go": {
      "models": {
        "glm-5.3-flash": {
          "variants": {
            "low": {
              "disabled": true
            },
            "high": {
              "disabled": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

@jpedrick I solved with this:

`~/.config/opencode/tui.json`
```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/tui.json",
  "keybinds": {
    "input_submit": "ctrl+return",
    "input_newline": "return,ctrl+j"
  }
}
```

For other options, https://opencode.ai/docs/keybinds/ might be of help.
